{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moonrite</strong> is a survival crafting game where you build a village, craft powerful spirit companions, and fight to survive in a beautiful anime-inspired world split between day and night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a dangerous land, gather resources, and construct your village by day. Under the moonlight uncover rare materials, encounter strange creatures, and grow your settlement with unique spirits summoned through sacred lunar rituals. Your survival depends on who you choose to fight by your side.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Recruit, Bind, and Command Spirits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398010/extras/5259b01e1eaa35cae6ce0650f1702a1b.poster.avif?t=1769533830\" width=1170 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398010/extras/5259b01e1eaa35cae6ce0650f1702a1b.webm?t=1769533830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon spirit companions through the moonrite and bind them to weapons and tools. Craft spirits combining resources you find in the world to give them unique properties and traits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your companions will fight alongside you and work to strengthen and specialize your village. Mastering how and where to use them is key to survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build, Customize, and Defend Your Village</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398010/extras/9229049c01f9c276f6cc4c63c27c0582.poster.avif?t=1769533830\" width=1170 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398010/extras/9229049c01f9c276f6cc4c63c27c0582.webm?t=1769533830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and construct a living settlement to shelter your spirits from the sun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft buildings from materials found in the world, assign spirits to assist you, and defend your home against growing threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your village is more than a simple base, it is where you protect, nurture, and turn your spirits into powerful allies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive a land in eternal conflict between Sun and Moon </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398010/extras/614ea6bd055c13475eb7aa592e801df6.poster.avif?t=1769533830\" width=1170 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398010/extras/614ea6bd055c13475eb7aa592e801df6.webm?t=1769533830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sun nourishes the flora and awakens dangerous beasts, which can drop valuable resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The moon provides shelter and power to capture souls, turning them into spirits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will need to master both in order to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Solo or in Online Co-Op</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398010/extras/70d54bf50db5eb53fd3b3f357387e2ee.poster.avif?t=1769533830\" width=1170 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398010/extras/70d54bf50db5eb53fd3b3f357387e2ee.webm?t=1769533830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive alone with your spirit companions or join friends in online co-op.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, build, and fight together in a shared world where cooperation and planning make the difference between collapse and prosperity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore Whimsical Procedural Worlds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398010/extras/81fb3c6c0491c2f57c197a25e9d8e1ae.poster.avif?t=1769533830\" width=1170 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398010/extras/81fb3c6c0491c2f57c197a25e9d8e1ae.webm?t=1769533830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each world has dozen of landmarks that set them apart from others. Discover evolving biomes, spirit-infested dungeons, and powerful bosses across procedurally generated worlds with a whimsical anime aesthetic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each journey offers new spirits, locations, and builds, ensuring every playthrough feels fresh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>* Please note that Moonrite is a work-in-progress. All footage is from our early alpha build, so graphics and gameplay will evolve before the final release.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3398010?t=1769533830","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3398010?t=1769533830","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398010/083038ef4337f23e17b92f6ced08d402e4c830e4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769533830","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps