aysinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398010/extras/70d54bf50db5eb53fd3b3f357387e2ee.poster.avif?t=1769533830\" width=1170 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398010/extras/70d54bf50db5eb53fd3b3f357387e2ee.webm?t=1769533830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive alone with your spirit companions or join friends in online co-op.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, build, and fight together in a shared world where cooperation and planning make the difference between collapse and prosperity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore Whimsical Procedural Worlds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398010/extras/81fb3c6c0491c2f57c197a25e9d8e1ae.poster.avif?t=1769533830\" width=1170 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398010/extras/81fb3c6c0491c2f57c197a25e9d8e1ae.webm?t=1769533830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each world has dozen of landmarks that set them apart from others. Discover evolving biomes, spirit-infested dungeons, and powerful bosses across procedurally generated worlds with a whimsical anime aesthetic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each journey offers new spirits, locations, and builds, ensuring every playthrough feels fresh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>* Please note that Moonrite is a work-in-progress. All footage is from our early alpha build, so graphics and gameplay will evolve before the final release.</strong></p>","developers":["Haki Studios"],"ext_user_account_notice":"HAKI STUDIOS LTDA ","genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"des